==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 10~15 seconds<sup>300f~450f</sup>.
*5 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 35 seconds<sup>1,050f</sup>, delay 20~22 seconds<sup>600f~660f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns as the boss after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage won't pose much of a threat with the right combination of cats. Bring [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Rover Cat Mk II]] as meatshields, as well as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as your main attackers. Macho Leg's offensive power will supply you with steady cash while you whittle away at the enemies. Bring [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] too, if you have him.

